(Acme Booking System Redesign - Proposal) Tj T*
(Prepared for Acme Outdoor Co. by Maya Lindqvist Consulting) Tj T*
(Version: 2) Tj T*
(Date: 3 February 2026) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Summary) Tj T*
(Acme Outdoor Co. runs guided hiking and kayaking trips in Jamtland and the Stockholm) Tj T*
(archipelago. The current booking system was built in 2017, does not show live) Tj T*
(availability and regularly double-books guides when two customers check out at the same) Tj T*
(time. This proposal covers a redesign of the online booking system: availability search,) Tj T*
(bookings for groups, checkout and confirmation emails.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(About Maya Lindqvist Consulting) Tj T*
(Maya Lindqvist Consulting is a one-person product and service design practice based in) Tj T*
(Uppsala, Sweden. I help small and mid-sized organisations improve the booking, ordering) Tj T*
(and customer communication flows that their business depends on. Every engagement is led) Tj T*
(and delivered by me, with trusted specialists brought in for visual design or) Tj T*
(development when needed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(How I work) Tj T*
(Each project starts with a short discovery phase: interviews with staff and customers, a) Tj T*
(review of existing data and a walkthrough of the current tools. From there I sketch) Tj T*
(options, test them with real users and deliver working changes in small increments, so) Tj T*
(you see progress every two weeks. You get a shared project board, a written summary) Tj T*
(after every workshop and a fortnightly status note.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Scope) Tj T*
(Discovery workshops with the operations team, a new availability calendar, a simplified) Tj T*
(checkout, an admin view for trip leaders and a waitlist for sold-out trips.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Fees and payment) Tj T*
(The total fee is EUR 26,000. We propose a 50% initial payment upon signing \(EUR 13,000\),) Tj T*
(with the remaining 50% due on completion of the project.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Timeline) Tj T*
(Work starts on 2 March and finishes on 29 May 2026.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Warranty) Tj T*
(Defects reported within 60 days of launch are fixed at no extra cost.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Assumptions) Tj T*
(- You nominate one decision maker who can approve designs within five working days.) Tj T*
(- You provide access to analytics, the current system and the relevant staff.) Tj T*
(- Travel within Sweden is included. Travel outside Sweden is billed at cost.) Tj T*
(- Prices are in euro and exclude VAT.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Next steps) Tj T*
(If this proposal looks right, reply to confirm and I will send a services agreement for) Tj T*
(signature. This proposal is valid for 30 days from the date above.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
